{"seq":1,"slug":"exp-growth-system","title":"经验值与等级成长路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/loyalty-gamification-growth/growth-level/exp-growth-system","wordCount":2488,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"经验值与等级成长路径\">经验值与等级成长路径</h1><p>等级是游戏化增长里最通用的一件工具，也是最容易被做坏的一件。做得好，它提供了一个用户主动追求的中期目标，让「今天没有购物需求」的用户依然有理由打开应用；做得坏，它变成一个只涨不跌的数字，在半年后让所有用户都到了最高级，等级随之失去区分度，运营只好加一个更高的级别，然后重复这个过程。这一篇讲的是经验值与等级的状态机设计、等级曲线的数值取舍、以及「升级立即生效、降级延迟到周期边界」这条规则为什么几乎不可违反。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-成长值是状态-等级是状态的投影\">核心概念：成长值是状态，等级是状态的投影</h2><p>把「成长值」和「等级」分开是理解这一节的前提。成长值（经验值、EXP）是一个<strong>连续累积的数值</strong>，它只增不减（在大多数设计里）；等级是这个数值经过一条<strong>阶梯函数的投影</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>i</mi><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(x) = \\max\\{\\, i \\mid T_i \\le x \\,\\}, \\quad T_1 = 0 &lt; T_2 &lt; \\dots &lt; T_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 是成长值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 级的门槛。这个投影的工程价值在于它是<strong>纯函数</strong>——等级永远可以从成长值算出，不需要单独存储。任何把等级当独立字段并手动增减的实现，最终都会与成长值脱节，出现「成长值够但等级不对」的争议。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计维度</th>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成长值单调性</td>\n<td>只增不减</td>\n<td>用户无负反馈、易解释</td>\n<td>无法反映活跃度衰退</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>周期性衰减（按季/年）</td>\n<td>保持等级新鲜度</td>\n<td>用户会因降级而流失（需谨慎）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等级门槛</td>\n<td>线性递增</td>\n<td>易理解</td>\n<td>后期升级过慢或过快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>指数/多项式递增</td>\n<td>匹配参与度曲线</td>\n<td>需要数据拟合，不易解释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>分段线性</td>\n<td>可控且有解释力</td>\n<td>配置复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>升级生效时机</td>\n<td>立即</td>\n<td>反馈即时、体验好</td>\n<td>需要缓存一致性处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降级生效时机</td>\n<td>周期边界（季/年）</td>\n<td>用户可预期</td>\n<td>需双时间轴记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加成计算</td>\n<td>按当前等级</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>升级瞬间所有行为收益跳变</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后两行的组合是实践中的共识：<strong>升级立即生效，降级延迟到周期边界</strong>。逻辑是收益与损失的不对称——用户升到新等级时，如果权益要等到下个周期才生效，他会认为系统在赖账；而用户因为本周期活跃度下降要被降级时，立即执行会让他在一个毫无预警的时刻失去权益，这比「本季度结束后降级」的体验差得多，且会直接引发客服工单。这与兄弟 hub <code>23_membership-points-system</code> 的会员等级处理是同一原则，本 hub 侧重的是「成长值作为游戏化行为的产出」这一侧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"等级曲线的数值取舍\">等级曲线的数值取舍</h2><p>门槛序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的设计决定了这个系统能活多久。三种常见形态：</p>\n<p><strong>线性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i = c \\cdot i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>。优点是简单、可解释（「每 1000 成长值升一级」）；缺点是线性增长的等级数意味着高活跃用户会很快触顶。若日活用户每天获得 50 成长值，线性门槛 1000 意味着每 20 天升一级，一年 18 级——对多数产品来说等级数太多了。</p>\n<p><strong>指数</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i = a \\cdot r^{i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）。优点是高等级越来越稀有，天然保持了等级的区分度；缺点是前期升级过慢会让新用户失去耐心。典型做法是给指数曲线加一个「新手期打折」：前 5 级用线性，之后转指数。</p>\n<p><strong>分段线性</strong>：为不同活跃度的用户段落设置不同的斜率。它牺牲了公式的简洁，换来的是「运营可以按区间理解并调整」，在需要频繁调优的增长业务里往往最实用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>曲线形态</th>\n<th>到 10 级所需成长值</th>\n<th>到 50 级</th>\n<th>等级稀有度</th>\n<th>调优难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>10,000</td>\n<td>50,000</td>\n<td>差（人人能到）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>1.15</mn><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000 \\cdot 1.15^{i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>约 30,000</td>\n<td>约 1.2 亿</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分段线性（前 5 级斜率 1/3）</td>\n<td>约 25,000</td>\n<td>视配置</td>\n<td>可调</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判断曲线是否合适的操作指标不是「看起来合不合理」，而是<strong>等级分布</strong>：健康的分位数分布通常让最大的一级（通常是第 1、2 级）占 30%–50%，顶部两级合计不超过 1%–5%。如果上线一个月后发现 60% 的用户都是 LV5，说明门槛太低；如果 99% 的用户在 LV1，说明门槛太高或者成长值来源太少。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成长值的发放与幂等\">成长值的发放与幂等</h2><p>成长值的来源通常有三类：行为类（签到、任务、评价）、交易类（下单、复购）、社交类（分享、邀请）。它们共同的要求是<strong>每一次发放都必须幂等且可追溯</strong>——成长值虽然不可花费，但它是等级的输入，而等级决定权益，因此它实质上是有价值的，超发等同于资损。</p>\n<p>发放的幂等键应当由业务事件本身构成，而不是由发放逻辑生成：例如「订单 <code>order_id</code> 支付完成」是唯一的事件，用 <code>order_id</code> 作为幂等键，重复消费这条消息不会重复加成长值。这与积分发放的幂等设计完全一致，具体账务处理见 <code>../23_membership-points-system/</code>；本 hub 关注的是<strong>哪些行为该给多少成长值</strong>这条规则本身如何被配置与版本化——这部分与任务条件表达式共用同一套配置基础设施，见 <a href=\"../task-checkin-system/task-engine-model\">任务定义、条件判定与奖励引擎</a>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>exp</mtext><mi>u</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{exp}_u(t) = \\sum_{e \\in E_u(t)} v(e) \\cdot m(L_{t_e})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">exp</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0001em;vertical-align:-0.2501em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2501em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是事件的基础成长值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m(L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是事件发生时用户等级带来的倍率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是事件时间。注意倍率取的是<strong>事件发生时刻的等级</strong>而不是当前等级——否则一次等级回溯重算会改变历史成长值，而成长值一旦改变，等级就会漂移，形成一个需要迭代求解的不动点。锁定「事件时刻的等级」让这个式子的每一项都是常量，整个计算变成一次可重复求和。这个「按事件时刻取值而非按当前状态取值」的原则在账务与数据仓库里被反复使用——缓慢变化维 Type 2 正是把事实记录关联到<strong>其生效日期对应的那个版本</strong>，从而让历史交易永久反映当时的维值（来源：Slowly changing dimension (Type 2), <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slowly_changing_dimension）。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slowly_changing_dimension）。</a></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[业务事件 支付/签到/评价] --&gt; B[幂等键去重]&#10;    B --&gt;|重复| Z[丢弃]&#10;    B --&gt;|新事件| C[解析成长值规则与版本]&#10;    C --&gt; D[读取事件时刻的等级倍率]&#10;    D --&gt; E[原子累加成长值]&#10;    E --&gt; F[重新计算等级投影 L x]&#10;    F --&gt; G{等级变化?}&#10;    G --&gt;|升级| H[立即生效: 更新权益缓存 + 通知]&#10;    G --&gt;|不变| I[结束]&#10;    H --&gt; J[写等级变更历史 双时间轴]&#10;    K[周期边界任务] --&gt; L[按规则判定降级]&#10;    L --&gt; J\">graph TD\n    A[业务事件 支付/签到/评价] --&gt; B[幂等键去重]\n    B --&gt;|重复| Z[丢弃]\n    B --&gt;|新事件| C[解析成长值规则与版本]\n    C --&gt; D[读取事件时刻的等级倍率]\n    D --&gt; E[原子累加成长值]\n    E --&gt; F[重新计算等级投影 L x]\n    F --&gt; G{等级变化?}\n    G --&gt;|升级| H[立即生效: 更新权益缓存 + 通知]\n    G --&gt;|不变| I[结束]\n    H --&gt; J[写等级变更历史 双时间轴]\n    K[周期边界任务] --&gt; L[按规则判定降级]\n    L --&gt; J</pre><h2 id=\"权益解析与等级缓存\">权益解析与等级缓存</h2><p>等级必须被解析成<strong>资格</strong>才能产生价值：折扣率、免邮门槛、客服优先级、专属活动可见性。这里的工程难点是<strong>等级缓存的一致性</strong>——等级是一个被高频读取（每次请求都要判断用户能不能进某个活动）却低频变化（升级是稀有事件）的数据，是典型的缓存友好场景，但也因此容易与服务端规则脱节。</p>\n<p>推荐结构是<strong>事件驱动的主动失效</strong>：等级变更时不直接更新所有缓存，而是发布一条 <code>level_changed(user_id, new_level)</code> 事件，由各个读取方订阅并失效自己的本地缓存。这样等级的权威源只有一个（成长值 + 门槛配置），缓存只是它的投影。判断缓存是否健康的一个实用指标是「等级分布缓存值与数据库聚合值的偏差率」，它应当接近零——如果持续有偏差，说明某条变更路径没有发布事件。</p>\n<p>等级变更历史必须按<strong>双时间轴</strong>保存：事件生效时间（这个等级从何时开始有效）与记录时间（这条记录何时被写入）。理由是等级规则会变——如果半年后调整了门槛，历史升级记录需要能被重新解释，而双时间轴让「当时是什么等级」与「按今天规则看当时应该是什么等级」都能被回答。这与数据仓库里「缓慢变化维 Type 2」的做法同源：属性变化时插入新版本行并记录起止日期，事实记录按生效日期关联到对应版本，从而永久保留历史取值（来源：Slowly changing dimension (Type 2), <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slowly_changing_dimension）。这与会员积分系统的等级历史设计是同一种模式。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slowly_changing_dimension）。这与会员积分系统的等级历史设计是同一种模式。</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>成长值与等级必须分离</strong>：等级是成长值经阶梯函数的投影，不单独存储，避免两者脱节。</li>\n<li>等级的通用规则是<strong>升级立即生效、降级延迟到周期边界</strong>，理由是收益与损失的不对称会直接转化为客服工单。</li>\n<li>等级曲线用<strong>分布指标</strong>验证（顶部两级占比 1%–5%），而不是靠直觉判断门槛合不合理；分段线性通常在频繁调优的业务里最实用。</li>\n<li>成长值发放必须<strong>幂等且可追溯</strong>，幂等键来自业务事件本身；倍率取<strong>事件发生时刻的等级</strong>，避免回溯重算导致的不动点。</li>\n<li>等级的权威源唯一（成长值 + 门槛配置），缓存只是投影，靠 <code>level_changed</code> 事件主动失效；用缓存与库的分布偏差监控一致性。</li>\n<li>等级变更历史按<strong>双时间轴</strong>保存，使规则变更后历史记录仍可被重新解释。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>等级提供的是「慢慢变强」的满足感，但它反馈太慢，无法制造即时的兴奋。要在几秒钟内给用户一个强反馈，需要另一类玩法——见 <a href=\"gamified-interaction\">抽奖与互动小游戏接入</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"经验值与等级成长路径","id":"经验值与等级成长路径"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：成长值是状态，等级是状态的投影","id":"核心概念-成长值是状态-等级是状态的投影"},{"level":2,"text":"等级曲线的数值取舍","id":"等级曲线的数值取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"成长值的发放与幂等","id":"成长值的发放与幂等"},{"level":2,"text":"权益解析与等级缓存","id":"权益解析与等级缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"成就与里程碑体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/loyalty-gamification-growth/task-checkin-system/achievement-milestone"},"next":{"title":"抽奖与互动小游戏接入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/loyalty-gamification-growth/growth-level/gamified-interaction"}}